@startuml
title VRL Debugger — evaluation pipeline
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Receive original program prefix, input, captured names and optional checkpoints / edits;
:Insert applicable edits, remap checkpoint and loop offsets;
:Instrument event, locals and checkpoint capture, guard future loop bodies;
:Write temporary VRL and JSONL files, invoke Vector without a shell and with timeout;
if (Compile / syntax failure and locals capture was enabled?) then (yes)
:Retry once without locals, retain warning if baseline succeeds;
else (no)
:Do not retry runtime, timeout or protocol failures;
endif
if (Subprocess and encoded output valid?) then (yes)
:Decode base64 JSON, validate event, locals, position and iteration metadata;
:Return RunResult, session computes diffs and caches snapshot;
else (no)
:Raise DebugError with stdout, stderr and error category;
endif
:Temporary files removed on exit, failed step preserves last successful values in session;
stop
@enduml
